E'Mai''Lafiya began in 2008 as a small family trading business in Bompai, Kano. Helping neighbours and suppliers find reliable warehouse space taught us that in Northern Nigeria, property is built on relationships and reputation.\n\nToday we are a registered real-estate, property-management and construction-consulting firm serving six cities, with 340+ transactions and ₦12B+ in deals closed — and we still walk every property ourselves.',
'Our values','What we hold ourselves to','Mr. Kingsley Agena','Founder & Chief Executive','When you trust us with a property, you are trusting us with your family''s or your company''s future. We never forget that.','assets/ceo-portrait.jpg');

